# Top-level dependencies for the SERVER side, pinned to versions verified on PyPI on 2026-09-17 (imgedit)
# and re-verified for this repo on 2026-09-21. torch/torchvision come from the Dockerfile torch layer
# (cu129 index) and are NOT listed here. ai-toolkit's own requirements are installed by the Dockerfile
# from its pinned checkout (torch lines filtered out) BEFORE this file, so these pins win on conflict.
# requirements.lock.txt is derived from the union by Phase 0 (pip freeze inside the v0 image).
